{"id":"habitude","lemma":"habitude","pos":"noun","rank":559,"glosses":["habit (action done on a regular basis)"],"ipa":"/a.bi.tyd/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/Fr-habitude.ogg/Fr-habitude.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"habitudes"},"formAudio":{"habitudes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-habitudes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Fumer est une mauvaise habitude.","en":"Smoking is a bad habit.","words":[{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"},null]},{"text":"Ils ont les mêmes habitudes.","en":"They have the same habits.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"same","l":"même"},null]},{"text":"J'ai l'habitude du froid.","en":"I'm used to the cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103091","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"cold"}]},{"text":"Êtes-vous prisonnier de vos habitudes ?","en":"Are you a creature of habit?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"prisoner"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null]},{"text":"Es-tu prisonnier de tes habitudes ?","en":"Are you a creature of habit?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"prisoner"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}